OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FA train operator has launched a
OL,7,Fcrackdown on fare dodgers who
OL,8,Fdeliberately buy a ticket for only
OL,9,Fpart of their journey.
OL,11,FSouth Western Railway (SWR) said it
OL,12,Fidentified widespread misuse of
OL,13,Felectronic tickets by passengers
OL,14,Fengaged in what is known as short-
OL,15,Ffaring or short-ticketing.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/9
