PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FIt found that up to 95% of barcode
OL,7,Ftickets ` which can be bought and
OL,8,Fdisplayed on a phone ` purchased for
OL,9,Fthe four-minute journey between
OL,10,FVauxhall and London Waterloo were
OL,11,Fbeing used fraudulently, putting #1
OL,12,Fmillion of revenue at risk.
OL,14,FThese tickets open the barriers at
OL,15,FLondon Waterloo, and are considerably
OL,16,Fcheaper than for long-distance
OL,17,Fjourneys on SWR's network, which
OL,18,Fstretches to Devon and Dorset.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FSWR's crackdown has involved deploying
OL,7,Fmore revenue protection staff at
OL,8,FVauxhall to ensure everyone who enters
OL,9,Fthe station with an electronic ticket
OL,10,Fhas it scanned.
OL,12,FWhen a fare dodger arrives at London
OL,13,FWaterloo with an electronic ticket
OL,14,Ffrom Vauxhall that was not scanned at
OL,15,Fthe start of the journey, it is
OL,16,Fapparent they have travelled from
OL,17,Ffurther away.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
