PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FPassengers caught without the correct
OL,7,Ftrain ticket must pay a #100 Penalty
OL,8,FFare ` halved if paid within 21 days `
OL,9,Fand buy a single ticket for their
OL,10,Fjourney.
OL,12,FThose found to be repeat offenders can
OL,13,Fface prosecution.
OL,15,FSince June, SWR's trial has identified
OL,16,F153 short-faring offences, compared
OL,17,Fwith seven during the same period last
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/9
