OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FRecent cases include a passenger who
OL,7,Fevaded #20,000 over three years while
OL,8,Ftravelling between Surrey and London,
OL,9,Fwhile another owed more than #11,000
OL,10,Fafter travelling from Hampshire to the
OL,11,Fcapital for more than four years.
OL,13,FEarly data suggests about a third of
OL,14,Fpassengers previously identified by
OL,15,FSWR as conducting the short-faring
OL,16,Fscam are now purchasing the correct
OL,17,Fticket for their journey.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
