PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FThe trial has demonstrated how quickly
OL,7,Fsome fare dodgers adapt their tactics,
OL,8,Fwith one alternative SWR station in
OL,9,FLondon seeing an 89% increase in
OL,10,Fbarcode ticket purchases.
OL,12,FMatthew Winnie, SWR and Network Rail
OL,13,FWessex chief customer and commercial
OL,14,Fofficer, said: "The overwhelming
OL,15,Fmajority of our customers pay the
OL,16,Fcorrect fare.
OL,26,@vD@POU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
