OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,F"However, there's growing evidence of
OL,7,Fsome people deliberately exploiting
OL,8,Fthe system ` a criminal offence that
OL,9,Fdeprives the railway of hundreds of
OL,10,Fmillions of pounds each year.
OL,12,F"We know our customers don't like
OL,13,Fseeing blatant fare evasion, whether
OL,14,Fthat's tailgating through ticket gates
OL,15,For simply travelling without a ticket.
OL,17,F"But we're also tackling the less
OL,18,Fvisible forms of fare fraud, including
OL,19,Fshort-faring and misuse of e-tickets.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,F"Every fare avoided is money that
OL,7,Fcan't be reinvested into improving the
OL,8,Frailway and delivering the best
OL,9,Fpossible service.
OL,11,F"We have a responsibility to protect
OL,12,Frevenue and our specially trained
OL,13,Fteams work around the clock to check
OL,14,Ftickets on stations and trains to
OL,15,Fimprove fairness for the millions of
OL,16,Fcustomers who do the right thing."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@bO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/9
