PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785763122
OL,3,CTrain operator cracking down on short-
OL,4,Cfaring ticket scam
OL,6,FIndustry body the Rail Delivery Group
OL,7,Festimates that at least #350 million
OL,8,Fto #400 million of annual fares
OL,9,Frevenue is lost to fraud and
OL,10,Fticketless travel each year.
OL,12,FSWR, which said fare evasion costs it
OL,13,Fabout #40 million annually, said it
OL,14,Fhas cut the practice by 67% since 2017.
